## 3.3 Automated PDF Generation

[PDFGenerator.java](file:///c:/Users/shrut/Downloads/Resume%20Generator/src/com/resumegenerator/export/PDFGenerator.java) uses **iText 5.5.13.3** to convert rendered resume content into a PDF file:

```
PDFGenerator.createPDF(resume, "resume_modern.pdf")
  → resume.renderWithTemplate()
       → template.render(user)  // returns formatted String
  → new Document()
  → PdfWriter.getInstance(document, new FileOutputStream(fileName))
  → document.open()
  → document.add(new Paragraph(content))
  → document.close()
  → ✅ PDF Created: resume_modern.pdf
```

Two overloads for flexibility:
- `createPDF(String content, String fileName)` — raw content (legacy)
- `createPDF(Resume resume, String fileName)` — template-aware (calls `renderWithTemplate()` internally)

